//Advanced Topics (decorators, generators, iterators, context managers)
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in English.","instruction":"Explain what decorators are in Python with a simple example.","output":"Decorators in Python are used to modify the behavior of a function without changing its code. Example:\ndef my_decorator(func):\n    def wrapper():\n        print('Before function')\n        func()\n    return wrapper\n@my_decorator\ndef say_hi():\n    print('Hi')\nsay_hi()\nHere, the decorator adds extra behavior to the function."}
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in English.","instruction":"Explain generators and iterators in Python with an example.","output":"Generators and iterators are used to iterate over data efficiently. A generator uses the yield keyword. Example:\ndef count():\n    for i in range(3):\n        yield i\nfor num in count():\n    print(num)\nThis generates values one by one without storing them all in memory."}
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in Hindi.","instruction":"Python में decorator क्या होता है? Simple code example के साथ समझाओ।","output":"Python में decorator का उपयोग function के behavior को modify करने के लिए होता है बिना function बदले। Example:\ndef decor(func):\n    def inner():\n        print('Start')\n        func()\n    return inner\n@decor\ndef hello():\n    print('Hello')\nयह decorator function में extra functionality जोड़ता है।"}
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in Hindi.","instruction":"Python में generator और iterator को आसान शब्दों में समझाओ।","output":"Python में generator और iterator data को one by one access करने के लिए use होते हैं। Generator yield keyword का use करता है। Example:\ndef gen():\n    yield 1\n    yield 2\nयह memory efficient होता है।"}
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in Marathi.","instruction":"Python मध्ये advanced topics जसे decorator, generator beginner साठी code example सह समजावून सांगा.","output":"Python मध्ये decorator function चा behavior बदलतो आणि generator yield वापरतो. Example:\ndef show():\n    yield 'Hi'\nGenerator मुळे values एक एक करून मिळतात आणि memory वाचते."}
