{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in English.","instruction":"Explain what best practices are in Python with examples.","output":"Best practices in Python help make code readable, maintainable, and error-free. Examples include following PEP 8 for code style, writing documentation, and using type hints. Example:\ndef add(a: int, b: int) -> int:\n    return a + b\nThis code is clear and easy to understand."}
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in English.","instruction":"Explain PEP 8 coding style rules with a simple example.","output":"PEP 8 is the official Python style guide. It recommends rules like using lowercase variable names and proper spacing. Example:\n# Good\nmy_variable = 10\n# Bad\nMyVariable=10\nFollowing PEP 8 improves code readability."}
{"system":"You are a Python Tutor. Explain in Hindi.","instruction":"Python में PEP 8 और documentation का महत्व समझाओ।","output":"Python में PEP 8 code लिखने का standard तरीका बताता है। Documentation से code समझना आसान होता है। Example:\ndef greet():\n    """This function prints greeting"""\n    print('Hello')\nइससे code readable बनता है।"}
